title: "CESM2 LENS ML Readiness Cookbook"
abstract: "A supervised classification on NSF NCAR's CESM2 Large Ensemble (AWS Open Data): does the autumn ENSO state predict a wet Front Range winter? The notebook follows NSF Unidata's Supervised Machine Learning Readiness spine, splits by ensemble member, and measures a weak signal honestly. Drafted with AI assistance (Anthropic's Claude) under the author's direction."
